This product also reproduces short portions of GRAB-RAG
(https://github.com/andre44s/grab-rag, commit
2006561476b39a6cd1ebc0ab5df1b09af01dbcab), licensed under the MIT License:

  - the text of its system message `sys_base` from src/policies.py, verbatim;
  - the layout of its `P0` user message ("Context:" ... "Question: ...") and of
    one passage ("<title>: <text>") from src/policies.py and src/runner.py;
  - its answer normalisation and `contains_answer` rule (src/utils.py) and its
    supportive-condition (`Q100`) passage order (src/context_quality.py,
    src/runner.py), re-implemented.

They are in src/binding_gate/datasets/grab_rag.py. No GRAB-RAG data (questions,
answers or passages, which derive from Natural Questions, CC BY-SA 3.0, and
HotpotQA, CC BY-SA 4.0) is included in this repository; test fixtures use
invented text.

