PR 8 (layer 3) uses the SealQA dataset (https://huggingface.co/datasets/vtllms/sealqa,
revision 0e75db526ad93dd039714897b7631afc03510e30; Pham et al., "SealQA: Raising
the Bar for Reasoning in Search-Augmented Language Models", arXiv 2506.01062),
licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0. No SealQA data is included in
this repository: the user downloads it into data/raw/ (git-ignored) with
`python -m binding_gate.cli dataset-prepare`; test fixtures use invented text.

Web pages fetched during layer-3 runs are third-party material. They are
stored privately with the run (runs/<run_id>/snapshots/, git-ignored); only
their URLs, fetch times and SHA-256 hashes are published.
